        "description": "The muted/heard pair on the INPUT card, where the generic 'still records and still plays' is meaningless — the monitor path never records and never plays. Answers the question the input card actually raises: why two switches for hearing one input. Both gates must be open (engine_process.c: `!mon_on[c] || mon_mut[c]` silences)."
