        "description": "The chain caption on the INPUT card. The generic string stops at 'out of the sound', which on an input is half the story: _snapshotMonitorChainsOntoLanes bails on a disabled chain, so the take is dry too. Saying so only after the fact — in fxChainOffInputConsequence — tells people once it is too late."
    },
